{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Request Auth — Acquire Permit → Make Request → Release\nFlow for scrapers and cache services obtaining a rate-limited permit before any outbound web request.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**START**\nScraper (or cache service) needs to make an outbound HTTP request",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[Scraper / cache service]**\n`permit = client.acquire(\"domain.com\")` — call blocks until permit is granted",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[RequestAuthClient — Python lib]**\nEnqueues `PermitRequest { domain, req_id }` and sends it over the open gRPC bidi stream",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[request-auth-server — Go]**\nReceives request; reads domain bucket config from Postgres\nChecks active permit count against configured pool limit",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "decision",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Pool has capacity?",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 470,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "branch-yes",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**YES — capacity available**\nPermit issued immediately",
      "x": -220,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "branch-no",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**NO — at capacity**\nRequest queued; waits until a running permit is returned and backoff expires",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[request-auth-server]**\nSends `PermitGrant { permit_id, req_id }` back via gRPC stream to the waiting caller",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[RequestAuthClient]**\nReceives grant, resolves the pending result queue for `req_id`\nReturns a `Permit` object to the caller — `acquire()` unblocks",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 870,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[Scraper / cache service]**\nMakes the outbound HTTP request to the target site\n`response = requests.get(url)`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[Scraper / cache service]**\nCalls `permit.release(response.status_code)` — or exits the `with client.acquire(…) as permit:` context manager\n(auto-releases with code 0 on exception)",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[RequestAuthClient]**\nSends `PermitReturn { permit_id, status_code }` via gRPC stream",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1280,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[request-auth-server]**\nRecords response status code\nApplies per-domain backoff timer (configurable; informed by robots.txt or admin override)",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1410,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[request-auth-server]**\nWhen backoff expires: decrements active count, issues permit to the\nnext queued request for the domain (if any)",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1550,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**END** — Permit returned to pool; domain rate limit enforced",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1690,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
